WEBVTT

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:03.840
<i>Fuwari, you doing well?</i>

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.440
<i>We're doing great!</i>

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:09.860
<i>It's almost time for the Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix.</i>

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:12.690
<i>Our rival is the Prodigy Team!</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.470
Its members are quite good.

00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:17.950
Sophie-san and Shion-san have also joined.

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.410
<i>They're prodigies, so there's not much we could do about it.</i>

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:23.750
<i>So the rest of us formed Team Effort to compete with them.</i>

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>Mirei is especially pumped up for this.</i>

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.730
<i>I'll also be putting even more into this!</i>

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:30.210
<i>Way more than usual!</i>

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.420
<i>I wish to reform PriPara if I win.</i>

00:00:33.420 --> 00:00:35.610
<i>We'll take you up on it!</i>

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:38.930
<i>And your arraignment will have to wait until we win!</i>

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:42.890
<i>Anyway, there's no way we'll lose this time!</i>

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:45.160
<i>That's all I have for now, Fuwari.</i>

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:49.110
<i>Come back from the Palps as soon as you feel better!</i>

00:00:51.340 --> 00:00:52.360
Huh?

00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:55.410
President Minami!

00:00:55.410 --> 00:00:56.440
Manaka-san...?

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.630
Aren't you happy?!

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:59.810
We're finally going to be on the same team!

00:00:59.810 --> 00:01:02.240
I feel the same way!

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:04.330
I'll do the best I can with my inner strength!

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.120
That's right, this'll be a piece of cake since I'm on the team!

00:01:07.120 --> 00:01:11.610
That hastily made Prodigy Team will fall apart just like the bits you lose in the deep fryer!

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:12.320
Yeah.

00:01:12.320 --> 00:01:13.010
Devi!

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:13.590
Yeah.

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:14.800
Let's do the best we can!

00:01:14.800 --> 00:01:17.510
And, as our name suggests, we'll put in effort every day!

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.970
Capisce!

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:50.680
Showdown!

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:52.790
At The Winter GrandPrix!

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:57.860
From here on out we'll be acting separately.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:00.800
Since we'll be concentrating on our training,

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:05.330
we won't be able to talk to each other until after our début concert.

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:07.080
Got it-pri.

00:03:08.540 --> 00:03:10.920
This is Mikan's food.

00:03:10.920 --> 00:03:14.330
Any other important notes are in this caretakers guide.

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:19.630
Allow us to go all out and have a battle that will shake the heavens!

00:03:19.630 --> 00:03:21.100
Everything is on the line!

00:03:21.100 --> 00:03:22.140
I won't hold back!

00:03:22.140 --> 00:03:23.140
There's no way...

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:24.390
...we'll lose!

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:27.390
I want to eat together on New Year's Day...

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:30.140
Lala, let's do our best against each other.

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:31.270
Capisce!

00:03:33.430 --> 00:03:36.040
All right, let's head to our dressing room, too!

00:03:36.040 --> 00:03:37.860
Kim!

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.990
Hold on-matisse!

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:42.950
Take care, everyone!

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:44.410
Thanks be to the Picture of Reiko!

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:50.370
This is sudden, but Ponkan will be returning to Persailles, Prance-daVinci.

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.080
Eh?!

00:03:51.080 --> 00:03:52.710
Where's Persailles?

00:03:52.710 --> 00:03:55.030
It's near PriPari-pri.

00:03:55.030 --> 00:03:56.790
It's Ponkan's hometown-daVinci!

00:03:59.520 --> 00:04:01.720
Everyone's a cicada friend!

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:04.180
What the heck?

00:04:04.180 --> 00:04:06.410
Good luck at the WinDrea-terracotta!

00:04:06.410 --> 00:04:08.150
The Great Buddha Statue of Nara bids thee bye-bye!

00:04:08.150 --> 00:04:10.600
And she leaves like a storm-pri.

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:13.060
Get us some souvenirs!

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:19.870
Wow!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:25.030
Time to dig in-nano!

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.490
Hi there!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:29.830
Go! You even have one!

00:04:29.830 --> 00:04:33.660
Mage-chan must have gathered all these for us.

00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:36.770
Did you tamper with the system again?

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:37.750
No.

00:04:37.750 --> 00:04:40.550
Have you not seen a top class dressing room before?

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:41.730
Ah...

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:43.760
Isn't being part of a team thrilling?

00:04:47.890 --> 00:04:52.770
You see, the excitement from back then has always remained here, inside Falulu.

00:04:52.770 --> 00:04:55.950
You've always put on solo concerts.

00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:58.020
Yeah, so this is exciting!

00:04:58.020 --> 00:04:58.910
All right.

00:04:58.910 --> 00:05:02.490
Let's practise as much as we can and put on a great concert for Falulu!

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:05.350
Actually, for those chosen as prodigies,

00:05:05.350 --> 00:05:10.740
overexerting or singing yourself hoarse are unnecessary.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:13.040
1, 2, ca, pisce.
1, 2, pri, pri.

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:14.820
3, 4, devi, devi.

00:05:14.820 --> 00:05:16.700
5, 6, ma, x.

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:18.790
7, 8, re, lax.
7, 8, pri, pri.

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:20.000
1, 2, ca, pisce.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:22.450
Yes, great, they're in perfect sync-kuma.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:23.970
They're looking good-usa.

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.090
This isn't enough-pri!

00:05:25.090 --> 00:05:29.050
I'm sure the Prodigy Team is practising even harder right now-pri!

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:30.910
1, 2, ca, pisce.
1, 2, pri, pri.

00:05:30.910 --> 00:05:32.880
3, 4, devi, devi.
3, 4, pri, pri.

00:05:32.880 --> 00:05:34.780
5, 6, ma, x.
5, 6, pri, pri.

00:05:34.780 --> 00:05:37.020
7, 8, re, lax.
7, 8, pri, pri.

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:45.750
I decided to reuse this boat that was abandoned at the dock.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.950
It seems like it was last used about three years ago.

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:53.850
It's said that Puhrphil Symphony No. 5, conducted by Purtwängler,

00:05:53.850 --> 00:05:55.910
is a famous and legendary piece.

00:05:55.910 --> 00:05:58.420
What a beautiful song.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:00.420
What about practice?

00:06:01.330 --> 00:06:05.380
We'll be fine with a single practice run the day before WinDrea.

00:06:05.380 --> 00:06:06.220
What?!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:11.240
More importantly, we'll take in this first-class art and use it as inspiration.

00:06:11.240 --> 00:06:13.460
This is most fitting for a prodigy.

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:16.180
It's the first step towards my ideal CelePara.

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.500
CelePara?

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:19.770
The AsParagus is delicious, too!

00:06:20.470 --> 00:06:22.350
That felt great!

00:06:22.350 --> 00:06:24.010
Now that we're in sync,

00:06:24.010 --> 00:06:26.490
it's time to choose the theme for our next concert-pri.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:31.870
We totally have to make our fans at the Dream Theatre feel like they've been taken to a world of dreams.

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:35.310
The Ninja's Ally Monja Man -Space Edition-!

00:06:35.310 --> 00:06:37.080
If you say so, Dorothy.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.350
Rejected!

00:06:38.350 --> 00:06:39.540
Why not?!

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:44.230
The first chapter of the Aloma Prophesy Grimoire reads as thus:

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:48.260
"The five witches who manipulate long things will bring forth a miracle"-dealo.

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.970
Long things?

00:06:50.980 --> 00:06:52.180
Ah! Got it!

00:06:53.600 --> 00:06:56.140
How does turning into witches and dancing sound?

00:06:56.670 --> 00:06:59.800
We can cast magic while dancing with a broom!

00:06:59.800 --> 00:07:03.360
"We're all friends! We're all idols!"

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:07.030
Witches, brooms, magic...

00:07:07.030 --> 00:07:08.320
Not a bad idea-pri!

00:07:08.320 --> 00:07:11.670
But can we do it?

00:07:11.670 --> 00:07:12.990
Yeah...

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:15.790
Dancing while holding brooms sounds difficult.

00:07:18.170 --> 00:07:20.710
If it's difficult, it means it'll also be rewarding-pri!

00:07:20.710 --> 00:07:22.930
It's been like that the whole time-pri.

00:07:22.930 --> 00:07:26.170
It's not like we were just playing at being friends-pri!

00:07:26.170 --> 00:07:29.050
We've been through many hardships, have learned a lot,

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.090
and have really worked our selves to the bone.

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:32.790
It may have only been a little at a time,

00:07:32.790 --> 00:07:34.870
but we have ranked up-pri!

00:07:35.360 --> 00:07:40.640
So this time, I'm sure we can do our best by putting in 102% effort-pri!

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:41.850
Mirei!

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:42.920
All right,

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.940
in that case, I'll um...

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.170
...add 30% to that 102%!

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:50.530
And I'll add 33%!

00:07:50.530 --> 00:07:53.040
Then I shall increase it by 36%-dealo.

00:07:53.040 --> 00:07:55.150
You're all being quite reserved.

00:07:55.150 --> 00:07:59.870
With it being the five of us, I'll max it out with another 100%!

00:08:00.680 --> 00:08:05.080
According to my calculations, that adds up to 301%-pri.

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:06.630
Which means...

00:08:07.100 --> 00:08:09.360
Mi-re-i!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:10.300
Nekon!
Usa!
Kuma!

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.460
Hooray! It's Mirei! It's Mirei!

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:14.310
All right! We're all on board-pri!

00:08:14.310 --> 00:08:17.490
We're in for some intense training with the 301% effort-pri!

00:08:17.490 --> 00:08:19.000
Pri!

00:08:20.730 --> 00:08:21.930
Ready, set...

00:08:23.450 --> 00:08:25.590
Manaka-san, hold it 5 cm this way.

00:08:25.590 --> 00:08:27.990
Kurosu-san, you were three seconds off on the jump.

00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:29.560
Leona, you need to smile more.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:31.780
And Dorothy, you need to jump 7.3 mm higher.

00:08:31.780 --> 00:08:33.260
So small!
Capisce!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.630
Can you see, Falulu?

00:08:50.630 --> 00:08:52.340
Yeah, it's wonderful!

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:59.380
I will have you see all of the works the
Prademy Awards have given awards to.

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:04.310
In addition, there's also ballet, opera, fine arts, and industrial arts...

00:09:04.310 --> 00:09:06.730
Ah, it's Aloma-nano!

00:09:06.730 --> 00:09:08.480
Aloma!

00:09:08.840 --> 00:09:10.980
Hey, I understand your feelings,

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.360
but we both have special training-dearu.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.690
Come on, Mikan.

00:09:13.690 --> 00:09:15.360
Just a little-nano!

00:09:15.360 --> 00:09:18.700
Mikan's lacking Aloma and needs a charge!

00:09:20.210 --> 00:09:22.030
It's starting to come together-pri!

00:09:22.030 --> 00:09:23.820
No, we're not there yet.

00:09:23.820 --> 00:09:26.880
We have yet to reach 301%!

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:28.250
Let's do it again!

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:30.150
Capisce!

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:31.960
How about this?

00:09:31.960 --> 00:09:33.920
Don't you think this colour would be good?

00:09:33.920 --> 00:09:38.070
Hey, I want this dance formation to be more elaborate.

00:09:38.070 --> 00:09:40.200
I see, in that case...

00:09:40.200 --> 00:09:42.520
How about something like this?

00:09:42.520 --> 00:09:43.880
Sorry for the wait...

00:09:43.880 --> 00:09:44.810
Oh?

00:09:46.230 --> 00:09:48.560
301%...

00:09:48.560 --> 00:09:50.270
Mirei... Mirei...

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:56.200
It's been a while since it's felt like our hearts have come together as one.

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.880
Dorothy West,

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:04.090
Leona West,

00:10:04.090 --> 00:10:05.910
Kurosu Aloma,

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:06.580
and...

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:08.170
I'll have to show it off...

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:10.510
My burning inner strength...

00:10:10.510 --> 00:10:11.540
...Manaka Lala.

00:10:12.780 --> 00:10:15.520
With the five of us, I'm sure a miracle will come about!

00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:17.010
No, it has to!

00:10:17.530 --> 00:10:20.700
We're all friends! We're all idols!

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.110
It's finally time for the WinDrea!

00:10:30.110 --> 00:10:32.150
Which team do you think will win?

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:34.150
That's a no brainier, the Prodigy Team.

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:35.500
I think so too!

00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:37.190
You don't know that.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:40.110
Lala and her team have been putting in a lot of effort!

00:10:41.350 --> 00:10:43.880
This day has finally come...

00:10:44.410 --> 00:10:48.220
In my position, I must treat all idols fairly,

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:52.080
but this time Team Effort has been on my mind more than any other.

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:55.390
I'm sorry, but do you think you could change the commentator?

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:56.950
Sorry, no can do.

00:10:56.950 --> 00:10:59.300
But aren't the two of us friends?

00:10:59.300 --> 00:11:01.260
It's the system.

00:11:02.290 --> 00:11:03.520
Ah...

00:11:03.520 --> 00:11:05.060
Guess I'll have to.

00:11:06.160 --> 00:11:08.730
Winter Dream Idol GrandPrix!

00:11:12.180 --> 00:11:14.820
It's the blanket of your heart, Mega-nii!

00:11:15.540 --> 00:11:17.910
I'll gently wrap around you any time.

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:18.650
It'll be fluffy-fluffy.

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:23.880
Now then, despite this being the WinDrea,

00:11:23.880 --> 00:11:31.120
most of the teams have dropped out, saying they wouldn't stand a chance against the Prodigy Team.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.630
As a result...

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:35.770
...it'll be a showdown between these two teams!

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:40.340
So without further ado, it's time for our first team!

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:42.300
Hey, come on!

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.010
Oh no!

00:11:44.010 --> 00:11:46.690
We haven't decided on a team name yet!

00:11:46.690 --> 00:11:47.730
Crap!

00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:49.820
We were so engrossed in our training that we forgot!

00:11:49.820 --> 00:11:51.210
Worry not-pri!

00:11:51.210 --> 00:11:52.730
I've got an idea-pri.

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:56.060
We're all friends. We're all idols.

00:11:56.060 --> 00:11:58.190
As those feelings are dear to us...

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:02.650
Coord Change Start!

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:08.140
The ribbon of an apprentice witch shows her clumsiness and coolness.

00:12:08.140 --> 00:12:09.710
And she'll always get through it with a smile!

00:12:09.710 --> 00:12:11.410
Little Witch Ribbon Coord!

00:12:13.030 --> 00:12:16.680
The stars' light will illuminate the path to the heights apprentice witches aim for.

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:18.340
Little Witch Starlight Coord!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:19.130
Pri!

00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:20.170
Yeah!

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:21.440
Your heart will skip a beat!

00:12:21.440 --> 00:12:23.770
Even an apprentice witch's appeal is real!

00:12:23.770 --> 00:12:25.590
Little Witch Heartful Coord!

00:12:25.590 --> 00:12:26.560
Devi!

00:12:30.590 --> 00:12:33.970
(Friends + Idols)
Friendols's concert is now starting!

00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:36.100
You can do it!

00:12:37.560 --> 00:12:41.470
Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!

00:12:48.760 --> 00:12:49.990
So cute!

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.340
<i>We are fledgling witches,</i>

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:06.520
<i>but we'll show you that our dreams will come true!</i>

00:13:13.640 --> 00:13:18.610
<i>Magic to make everyone into beautifully smiling idols-pri!</i>

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:27.910
What an exciting concert-kuma!

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.610
Their singing and dancing is great!

00:13:29.610 --> 00:13:31.320
Not to mention their teamwork!

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:33.750
You couldn't do that without a lot of practice-usa!

00:13:38.420 --> 00:13:39.920
Airy Change!

00:13:40.600 --> 00:13:43.170
Cyalume Airy!

00:13:43.890 --> 00:13:45.630
<i>This isn't the Winter Coord!</i>

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.770
<i>The bell didn't appear...</i>

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:09.030
This is the loudest I've heard the crowd cheer since the Dream Theatre opened.

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:11.990
And with that, their idol rankings have gone up!

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:18.730
My inner strength didn't come out...

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:20.030
We lost-pri...

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:25.130
Are you sure we're okay with only practising once?

00:14:25.130 --> 00:14:26.780
I'm not confident.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:29.840
We've decided on the arrangement, the rest you can ad lib.

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:30.840
Ad lib?

00:14:31.540 --> 00:14:35.380
Feel each other's mood from moment to moment,

00:14:35.380 --> 00:14:38.430
and based on your instinct, dance while aiming for perfection.

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:41.710
Our concert will be a battle between members.

00:14:41.710 --> 00:14:44.480
I know you have it in you.

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:46.690
That's why I chose you.

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:48.590
Sounds like fun-nano!
Sounds like fun!

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:51.160
Based on our instincts?

00:14:52.270 --> 00:14:54.250
Coord Change Start!

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:03.730
A sharp celebrity tuxedo style for escorting the princesses.

00:15:03.730 --> 00:15:05.960
Escort Cinema Coord!

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:12.920
Here we have this gently flowing dress skirt with it's full volume feel and lots of frills.

00:15:12.920 --> 00:15:15.230
It gives off quite an elegant silhouette.

00:15:15.230 --> 00:15:17.020
Ballroom Cinema Coord.

00:15:17.460 --> 00:15:18.140
Gelrun!

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:19.180
Go!

00:15:19.180 --> 00:15:22.500
For additional accent they have large bird feathers.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:26.510
They're a focal point as they decorate the chest and legs and are a hair accessory.

00:15:26.510 --> 00:15:28.360
Ballroom Pearl Coord!

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:40.280
Allow us actresses wearing clothing of talent to show you the true beauty that is PriPara.

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:43.380
We are...

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:46.090
...CelePara Theatre Company!

00:15:46.090 --> 00:15:49.420
Dream Theatre Concert Switch On!

00:17:10.520 --> 00:17:12.610
Airy Change!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.620
Golden Airy!

00:17:19.050 --> 00:17:20.810
Golden Airy!

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:29.310
Thank you!

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.290
So sparkly!

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:33.860
Let's Go!

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:36.410
This is amazing!

00:17:53.390 --> 00:17:56.710
Ring the bell of everyone's dreams!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.850
Aim for a limitless height.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.600
Echo, Bell of Revolution!

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:37.760
CelePara Theatre Company wins by a landslide!

00:18:37.760 --> 00:18:40.220
This is the first time I've felt this...

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:42.420
My heart won't stop trembling.

00:18:42.420 --> 00:18:43.970
What is this?

00:18:43.970 --> 00:18:45.520
My heart's beating ecstatically.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:49.940
Will you entrust the future of PriPara to me?

00:18:49.940 --> 00:18:54.220
If you do, I promise to return PriPara to its golden age!

00:18:54.220 --> 00:18:55.650
I love you, Hibiki-sama!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.110
Hibiki-sama!

00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:01.700
Minami Mirei-kun, you know what this cheer means, right?

00:19:03.110 --> 00:19:04.910
You lost.

00:19:04.910 --> 00:19:06.120
Falulu is shining!

00:19:06.120 --> 00:19:08.120
And with that, Mega-niisan,

00:19:08.120 --> 00:19:09.770
you promised.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:12.080
Please allow me to reform PriPara.

00:19:12.790 --> 00:19:15.750
To do that, I need your glasses.

00:19:15.750 --> 00:19:21.130
You were born to support and protect these idols.

00:19:21.130 --> 00:19:25.690
As an idol who gets so much support from this idol audience,

00:19:25.690 --> 00:19:28.480
you should give me that chance you promised.

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:29.850
What's this?!

00:19:29.850 --> 00:19:32.310
And the tally of likes are in!

00:19:32.310 --> 00:19:37.230
Several idols have jumped up the rankings here as well!

00:19:37.230 --> 00:19:39.050
Hibiki-sama!

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:41.200
My Hibiki-sama!

00:19:41.930 --> 00:19:44.850
<i>I was born to protect these idols.</i>

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:49.660
<i>I wonder if she can make these idols happy...?</i>

00:19:50.820 --> 00:19:52.620
Understood.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:56.560
Please, these idols need...

00:19:58.870 --> 00:20:01.460
I'm returning from Stylish Tough Guy...

00:20:01.980 --> 00:20:04.090
...to a normal guy.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.090
All right,

00:20:13.090 --> 00:20:16.990
let us celebrate as the curtains rise on a place where prodigies gather,

00:20:16.990 --> 00:20:19.610
the new PriPara, CelePara!

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:35.460
We lost...

00:20:35.910 --> 00:20:39.270
Our 301% effort lost-pri.

00:20:39.270 --> 00:20:39.960
Mirei...

00:22:16.120 --> 00:22:16.940
Eh?!

00:22:16.940 --> 00:22:18.740
This is PriPara?!

00:22:18.740 --> 00:22:21.010
Better yet, what is CelePara?!

00:22:21.010 --> 00:22:22.310
The revolution has come-kuma!

00:22:22.310 --> 00:22:23.730
It's terrible-kuma!

00:22:23.730 --> 00:22:25.960
Mirei, what do we do?!

00:22:26.390 --> 00:22:27.260
Next time:

00:22:27.260 --> 00:22:29.930
Let's go! CelePara!
